msgstr "Ladeproblem.\nKontaktieren Sie den Support:\nhttp://supportinfo.\nharmonyremote.com"

#. Firmware screen 10, one line per line break, centred; about 160 pixels a line
msgctxt "system.screen.10"
msgid "Go to Website\nto update settings"
msgstr "Afterglow verwenden\nzum Aktualisieren der Einstellungen"

#. Firmware screen 11, one line per line break, centred; about 160 pixels a line
